    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Congrats to Ohio State men\u2019s &amp; women\u2019s tennis teams for NCAA tournament wins today. Cold day, tough conditions, didn\u2019t matter. Onwards! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\ud83c\udfbe\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050711454391972072",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T22:58:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Cut the tax &amp; regulatory burden to bring high-paying jobs back to our state in droves. That\u2019ll lift up the workers we met this week in Richfield &amp; across Ohio. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050628967032569867",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T17:30:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs, bigger paychecks, better schools.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050614344480915637",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T16:32:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We can be the top state in the country again. But that requires the right leader &amp; that\u2019s what November is all about.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050608893328531608",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T16:10:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A friend of the people is an enemy of bureaucracy. We\u2019re going to cut red tape &amp; unleash energy production in Ohio. That\u2019s how we bring down electric bills for the long run.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050591253763600830",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T15:00:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "An incredible town hall with some emotional moments last night in Cincinnati. You\u2019re counting on us &amp; we won\u2019t let you down. \ud83d\ude4f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050565722229911710",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T13:19:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great to go clay shooting with supporters &amp; friends in central Ohio, before we headed to our absolutely massive town hall in Cincinnati tonight. Might have been our best day yet.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050401640721850400",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T02:27:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Cincinnati Public Schools were closed for nearly two years during the COVID pandemic, while my alma mater, St. X, was closed for five days. My opponent complains about inequity while advancing the very policies that created it. It\u2019s inexcusable.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050385962132463658",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T01:24:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The decline of public school performance is really a story about the abandonment of standards. We\u2019re going to fix that starting next year.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050371996975034535",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T00:29:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Bureaucracy is crushing both K\u201312 &amp; higher education\u2014but not for much longer, at least in Ohio. Help is on the way.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050371731244953891",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T00:28:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Improving health outcomes &amp; reducing long-run costs are two sides of the same coin. That starts with the simplification of an overly complex system.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050307675150504305",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T20:13:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We rarely hear about the American Dream anymore. That\u2019s about to change here in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050271682854834274",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T17:50:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Coming in 2027. Get ready.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050270980829028437",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T17:47:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Three great stops across western Ohio yesterday. Agriculture is Ohio\u2019s oldest &amp; most important industry, and we\u2019ll continue to stand for our farmers.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050236529520566765",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T15:30:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grateful for everyone who\u2019s already cast their first ballot for us. Next one comes in November. \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050222655996068028",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T14:35:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Conservation is an essential part of a conservative worldview. Good discussion with local residents in Minster today about protecting Ohio\u2019s inland lakes.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050045250153202061",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:50:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Someone should ask my opponent Amy Acton the simple question this woman asked me: are you against boys competing in girls sports? Shouldn\u2019t be hard to answer.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050043632061964733",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:44:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The success of Ohio will include the success of every part of Ohio. Loved the optimism in Athens this week.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050036232210747720",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:15:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Love the energy. Keep it up, Mahoning County!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050028366775079369",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T01:43:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
